# 3-Day JavaScript Homework Plan

### Day 1: Operators & Conditionals
- `Day_1/01_operators.js`:
  - Arithmetic operators (`+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, `%`, `**`)
  - Relational operators (`==`, `===`, `!=`, `!==`, `>`, `<`, `>=`, `<=`)
  - Assignment operators (`=`, `+=`, `-=`, `*=`, `/=`, `%=`)
  - Logical operators (`&&`, `||`, `!`)
  - Increment & Decrement operators (`++`, `--`)
  - Bitwise operators (`&`, `|`, `^`, `~`, `<<`, `>>`)
- `Day_1/02_conditionals_and_switch.js`:
  - Types of if-else (simple if, if-else, ladder, nested, ternary)
  - Switch case statement
  - Assignments: Positive/Negative/Zero, Largest of 3, Leap Year

### Day 2: Loops & Jump Statements
- `Day_2/01_loops_break_continue.js`:
  - For loop, while loop, do-while loop, for...of loop
  - Break keyword
  - Continue keyword
- `Day_2/02_loop_assignments.js`:
  - Print 1 to 10 (for) & 10 to 1 (while)
  - Multiplication table
  - Sum of first N numbers
  - Factorial
  - Reverse a number (while loop)
  - Prime check
  - Star pattern

### Day 3: Strings & String Methods
- `Day_3/01_string_methods.js`:
  - All string methods (`length`, `charAt`, `at`, `charCodeAt`, `toUpperCase`, `toLowerCase`, `trim`, `slice`, `substring`, `indexOf`, `includes`, `replace`, `replaceAll`, `split`, `repeat`, `padStart`, `padEnd`, template literals)
- `Day_3/02_string_assignments.js`:
  - Vowels, consonants, and spaces counter
  - Palindrome checker
  - Reverse string
  - Title Case (Capitalize words)
  - Mask sensitive data (Credit Card / Mobile)
  - Word counter
